{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0193_1000_p", "source_sha256": "1ab66e1571a994960f8eed6a009b60127290bf8f079eff76ef834fddb2ed29b0", "ja": "（『聖ミリオン女学園』の撮影も終盤だ。\nそろそろ休憩が終わるけど、紬はどこだろう？）", "zh": "（《圣百万女学园》的拍摄已经接近尾声。休息时间也快结束了，可紬在哪儿呢？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0193_1001_051tmg", "source_sha256": "9d246dcdcc123f8d839375487973b4c34e3841d2af36162a7382ba5090ab668b", "ja": "ふぅ……。", "zh": "呼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0193_1002_p", "source_sha256": "0b3265d461435effd978c8c0b65b692f48de21a8e2ceaac25f31a9974ed330e1", "ja": "あ、いたいた。お疲れ様、紬。\n温室の花を見てたのか？", "zh": "啊，在这儿呢。辛苦了，紬。\n你刚才在看温室里的花吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0193_1003_051tmg", "source_sha256": "561d8c2c1617cb4401876835e80b6a3d54f5382b1484c90be678d4017c0d0d3b", "ja": "お疲れさまです、{$P$}。ええ。\n撮影中は、あまり眺めることもできませんでしたので。", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}。是的。\n拍摄期间，也没怎么有机会好好欣赏。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0193_1004_051tmg", "source_sha256": "c5cff8e3dfced840743583d3b97df25635f54585c892e4eedacbf7978db1fd49", "ja": "もうすぐ終わりだと思うと、すこし名残惜しく……\nこの景色を、目に焼き付けておこうかと思いまして。", "zh": "一想到马上就要结束了，就有些依依不舍……\n所以想把这片景色，深深烙印在眼里。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0193_1005_p", "source_sha256": "89e3b4415d40e7ecb294eea6c3e06ef5bafe7db86e37d253a4ccc2a0da865d51", "ja": "そうか。今回の撮影、みんな大変そうだったからな。\n少し心配だったけど、最後は楽しそうでよかったよ。", "zh": "这样啊。这次拍摄，大家看起来都挺辛苦的。我还有点担心，不过最后大家都像是玩得很开心，真是太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0193_1006_051tmg", "source_sha256": "d3b15a101ccf981c2d5f4874279405bed449ba59761768c520f8b51eb60651e5", "ja": "そうですね……皆それぞれ、複雑な感情を持った\n役どころでしたから。演じるのに、苦労しました。", "zh": "是啊……大家各自饰演的角色，都怀有复杂的感情。演起来很辛苦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0193_1007_051tmg", "source_sha256": "5a14ae5473739003bea6e5fba252d176dd65be3cfa13d3dd5e0ff383ceb41fc1", "ja": "佐竹さん、所さんにもお世話になりましたが……\nやはり周防さんの影響が、一番大きいのではないかと。", "zh": "佐竹小姐、所小姐也帮了我很多，不过……我觉得，果然还是周防小姐对我的影响最大。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0193_1008_p", "source_sha256": "4b69a2d869d4417548c352eeb6adf06300bcd18bb440d827e5ae8ab4f4a50c0d", "ja": "桃子の？", "zh": "桃子的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0193_1009_051tmg", "source_sha256": "12685524466413aac2f5fbac8f094056cc5f56a6478281b016efd453d51b30ef", "ja": "ええ。言い合いのシーンで何度もやり直しをした際、\n「お芝居で遠慮なんかしないで」と怒られてしまって。", "zh": "嗯。在争执的场景里反复重来时，她还生气地对我说：“演戏时不要顾虑什么。”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0193_1010_051tmg", "source_sha256": "90d450b8795725574762761494a1b66eff994421a8778bf4905291abf09c746f", "ja": "その言葉で、まだ役柄ではなく……劇場の仲間だと\n思って接していた自分に、気付かされました。", "zh": "正是那句话，让我意识到，自己当时并不是把对方当作角色，而是当作剧场的伙伴来相处……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0193_1011_051tmg", "source_sha256": "3ce113a0f5e3b95d4f9ab04ff31e785cf28ef3c8e0e02bbd75efecbf83a54062", "ja": "それをきっかけに、佐竹さんや所さんにも、思いきって\nぶつかることができるようになりましたから。", "zh": "也正因为那件事，我才终于能够鼓起勇气，去和佐竹小姐、所小姐她们正面交流了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0193_1012_p", "source_sha256": "98df24da40fa568e5f5587414b9266283e750d61a6ef72f8368d81a0381e3a40", "ja": "そうか。そうやって紬が苦労した分、どれも良い\nシーンになったと思う。ありがとう、頑張ったな！", "zh": "这样啊。正因为纺付出了那么多努力，我觉得每一个场景都拍得很不错。谢谢你，你辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0193_1013_051tmg", "source_sha256": "9260b8020c4535ad5c9c654cde15eb5878e4d524242811afa36e6ad32522a4cc", "ja": "……い、いきなり何ですか。\nそれに、撮影はまだ続いているんですよ？", "zh": "……突、突然说这个干什么。\n而且，拍摄还在继续呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0193_1014_p", "source_sha256": "4a4d76c750d8666fed0a985457bced9ae72c94c6d79609c8744787d5313c9adc", "ja": "ああ、そうだな。\n最後まで気を抜かずに、頑張っていこう！", "zh": "啊，说得也是。\n到最后都不能松懈，一起加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0193_1015_051tmg", "source_sha256": "081c645c0580c7a837129c31be2b853d6e585668f8bcdcd73e08d6ba99ca1fe1", "ja": "ええ。{$P$}も、一蓮托生。\nクランクアップするまで、油断は禁物です。", "zh": "是的。{$P$}也要和我同甘共苦。\n在杀青之前，绝不能掉以轻心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0193_1016_051tmg", "source_sha256": "f3a9d973e47296442c9176bd5fb4ccd8bc8366647e62adebe7b62f8772e45cfc", "ja": "最後まで、きちんと見ていてください。デラシネ……\n根なし草の力強さ、見せてさしあげましょう。ふふっ！", "zh": "请一直看到最后。漂泊者……\n就让您见识见识，无根之草的力量吧。呵呵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
